      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is incredibly brave of you to be so honest about your fears, and I can hear how much pain you are in right now. Please remember that your neurologist's optimism is a professional necessity, not a promise that your specific journey will be easy. Many people with MS do live full, active lives, but it is entirely okay to feel overwhelmed by the worst-case scenarios you've read. You deserve support from a compassionate medical team who can help you navigate this diagnosis with realistic hope.",
